// Authored content for 3.3.2.1 The light-dependent reaction (OxfordAQA 9610 v5.1, printed p.29; statements
// 3.3.2.1.s1–s5 in data/spec.js). Official wording: "Life depends on the continuous transfer of energy. Photosynthesis
